Package: jhttpd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: static web server built on jlib
 An HTTP/1.1 server for static files: virtual hosts by name, TLS with SNI,
 basic authentication, rate limiting and a per-address connection cap, all
 from one nginx-shaped configuration file.
 .
 Ships a systemd unit and a logrotate snippet. The unit checks the
 configuration with "jhttpd --test" before replacing a running server, so a
 typo fails the start rather than the site.

